802C10.5177 17.5731 10.0429 17.5731 9.75 17.2802C9.45711 16.9873 9.45712 16.5126 9.75 16.2197L16.4697 9.49994H0.75C0.335795 9.49994 1.4432e-05 9.16414 0 8.74994C0 8.33573 0.335786 7.99994 0.75 7.99994H16.4697L9.75 1.28022C9.45711 0.987328 9.45712 0.512564 9.75 0.21967Z"></path></g></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows 500ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div style="padding-inline:12px;transition:padding 500ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)"></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><main><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"OneSoil Mobile Is Moving to Freemium","description":"What changes in OneSoil mobile monitoring and what stays free: the last cloud-free image, weather stations, the hourly precipitation map and field notes.","image":"/api/media/file/OneSoil%20Mob%20Application.png","datePublished":"2026-05-04T10:00:00.000Z","dateModified":"2026-05-04T10:00:00.000Z","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"OneSoil"},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://onesoil.ai/en/resources/onesoil-mob-app-is-moving-to-freemium"}}</script><header class="w-full pb-6 pt-24 sm:pt-40" style="background-image:var(--hero-tint-green)"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1024px] flex-col items-center gap-6 px-6 sm:flex-row sm:gap-9 sm:px-12 lg:gap-12"><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-6 sm:gap-9"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:gap-4"><h1 class="text-foreground-primary text-[1.5rem] font-medium tracking-[-0.05rem] sm:text-[2rem] sm:tracking-[-0.075rem] lg:text-[2.5rem]">OneSoil Mobile Is Moving to Freemium</h1><p class="text-base font-light tracking-[-0.02rem] text-foreground-primary/60 sm:text-lg sm:tracking-[-0.025rem]">What changes in OneSoil mobile monitoring and what stays free: the last cloud-free image, weather stations, the hourly precipitation map and field notes.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-light text-foreground-primary/60 sm:text-sm"><span>May 4, 2026</span><span>·</span><span>Reading time · 3 minutes</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4"><div class="size-12 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full sm:size-16"><img alt="OneSoil" loading="lazy" width="200" height="200" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 48px, 64px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fonesoil-author-avatar.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-base text-foreground-primary sm:text-lg">OneSoil</span><span class="text-xs font-light text-foreground-primary/60 sm:text-sm">People, fields, and technology</span></div></div><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm text-foreground-primary"><a class="group flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 hover:text-foreground-primary/60" href="/en/resources"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" class="shrink-0 fill-current group-hover:fill-foreground-primary/60" aria-hidden="true"><g transform="translate(0, 0)"><path d="M13.7998 0C16.3199 4.05878e-10 17.5804 -0.000222195 18.543 0.490234C19.3895 0.921644 20.0774 1.61045 20.5088 2.45703C20.9993 3.41963 21 4.67996 21 7.2002V13.7998C21 16.32 20.9993 17.5804 20.5088 18.543C20.0774 19.3896 19.3895 20.0783 18.543 20.5098C17.5804 21.0002 16.3199 21 13.7998 21H7.19922C4.67958 21 3.41954 21 2.45703 20.5098C1.61032 20.0783 0.921666 19.3897 0.490234 18.543C-0.000236304 17.5804 0 16.32 0 13.7998V7.2002C0 4.67996 -0.000236304 3.41963 0.490234 2.45703C0.921668 1.61035 1.61034 0.921647 2.45703 0.490234C3.41953 4.64332e-06 4.6796 1.171e-09 7.19922 0H13.7998ZM7.15527 4.52539C7.15527 4.52539 5.48255 6.95633 5.48242 10.5088C5.48242 12.4618 6.0618 13.7176 6.83984 14.4355C7.62072 15.1535 8.49997 15.29 8.95703 15.29C9.71611 15.29 10.3013 14.9868 10.791 14.7324C10.946 14.6515 11.0927 14.5751 11.2314 14.5156L10.6055 12.9395C10.396 13.0282 10.1998 13.1172 10.0176 13.1992C9.54441 13.413 9.17466 13.581 8.95703 13.5811C8.78565 13.5811 8.34204 13.5243 7.96387 13.1807C7.58844 12.8368 7.15527 12.1382 7.15527 10.5088C7.15536 8.00148 7.98542 6.49524 8.30371 5.96777C8.72817 6.12354 9.18002 6.25281 9.64258 6.38477C10.3091 6.57488 10.9974 6.77168 11.6504 7.06348C12.3033 7.3539 12.8396 7.74092 13.2178 8.21191C13.5959 8.68255 13.8466 9.25035 13.8467 10.1348C13.8467 10.9795 13.5279 11.3907 13.2178 11.6846C13.1853 11.717 13.1608 11.7353 13.1338 11.7549L13.0869 11.791C12.6326 10.7294 11.9005 9.69463 10.7607 8.77344L9.74316 10.1348C12.1865 12.1094 12.1783 14.4305 12.1729 16.6748V17H13.8467C13.8467 15.9916 13.8377 14.763 13.582 13.501C13.8078 13.381 14.0906 13.1999 14.3682 12.9395C14.945 12.3983 15.5166 11.457 15.5166 10.1348C15.5165 8.90656 15.1355 7.87519 14.5234 7.11719C13.914 6.35945 13.1037 5.87111 12.3037 5.51367C11.327 5.07902 9.96892 4.70611 8.94043 4.42383C8.2797 4.24233 7.75767 4.09794 7.56152 4L7.15527 4.52539Z"></path></g></svg>OneSoil Resources</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0">\</span><a class="shrink-0 hover:text-foreground-primary/60" href="/en/resources/category/company-news">Company news</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0">\</span><span class="truncate text-foreground-primary/60" aria-current="page" title="OneSoil Mobile Is Moving to Freemium">OneSoil Mobile Is Moving to Freemium</span></div></div><div class="relative aspect-square w-full max-w-[280px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] sm:size-[320px] sm:max-w-none lg:size-[420px] lg:rounded-[2.5rem]"><img alt="A-phone-with-OneSoil-mob-application-interface" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 320px, 420px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520Mob%2520Application.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div></header><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6"><div class="pt-8"><article class="mx-auto max-w-[1024px]"><div class="[&amp;_a]:text-accent-success [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:transition-colors [&amp;_a]:hover:text-foreground-primary [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold [&amp;_strong]:text-accent-success"><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">We started OneSoil with one idea: precision agriculture should belong to every farmer, not just to those who can afford expensive software. That idea hasn’t changed. But the way we run monitoring in the mobile app has to.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">As our community grows, so does the cost of running the app: satellite data, infrastructure and continuous development. A free-only model can no longer support that. Moving to freemium lets us keep OneSoil reliable and keep building new features for you.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">From 5 May, OneSoil mobile moved to a freemium model. The update rolled out gradually, so you may have seen the change a little later than the announcement.</p><h2 id="what-stays-free-for-every-farmer" class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-[2.25rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.09rem] text-foreground-primary scroll-mt-24">What stays free for every farmer</h2><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">If you use the OneSoil app casually, to check on your fields once in a while, take notes during scouting or look at the weather before a workday, the free version will continue to do everything you need.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">Free for everyone, with no limit on the number of fields:</p><ul class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 list-disc"><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">The last cloud-free image per field: NDVI, moisture and satellite imagery</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Virtual weather stations</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Hyperlocal precipitation map for the next hour</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Field notes with photos and geolocation</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Access to all your fields and seasons</li></ul><h2 id="what-a-subscription-adds" class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-[2.25rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.09rem] text-foreground-primary scroll-mt-24">What a subscription adds</h2><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">For farmers who use OneSoil as a daily decision-making tool, tracking how each field develops, planning operations days ahead and comparing fields across the season, the paid tier opens up the features that make this possible:</p><ul class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 list-disc"><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Season-long history. NDVI, moisture and satellite imagery: see how each field evolves week by week, identify problem areas early, compare zones across the year.</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">4-hour hyperlocal precipitation forecast. Plan operations with precise short-range forecasting tied to your field, not the nearest weather station.</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Spraying windows recommendations. Know when conditions are right for treatment.</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Field boundaries download. Export your field boundaries for use in other systems.</li></ul><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">Coming soon for subscribers:</p><ul class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 list-disc"><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">VRA suitability: an assessment of which of your fields are suitable for variable-rate application</li><li class="ms-[1.7rem] mb-2 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary">Alerts and recommendations based on your current field conditions and historical context</li></ul><h2 id="how-subscriptions-work" class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-[2.25rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.09rem] text-foreground-primary scroll-mt-24">How subscriptions work</h2><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">Subscriptions are purchased directly through the App Store or Google Play, in your local currency.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">Pricing adapts to your region and the size of your operation, with additional savings on quarterly plans. You can review the options in the app once you update.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">If you work with a team, the subscription covers your entire workspace: every field, every season and everyone you have invited to work with you. One subscription per workspace, not per person.</p><h2 id="for-students-and-educators" class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-[2.25rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.09rem] text-foreground-primary scroll-mt-24">For students and educators</h2><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">If you are using OneSoil for academic or non-commercial purposes, write to us at <a href="mailto:care@onesoil.ai">care@onesoil.ai</a> and we will keep your access free.</p><h2 id="for-onesoil-pro-customers" class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-[2.25rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.09rem] text-foreground-primary scroll-mt-24">For OneSoil Pro customers</h2><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">If you have a Pro subscription, the new mobile features are already included. There is nothing you need to do.</p><h2 id="questions-and-answers" class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-[2.25rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.09rem] text-foreground-primary scroll-mt-24">Questions and answers</h2><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0"><strong>Will I lose my fields and notes if I don’t subscribe?</strong></p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">No. All your fields, seasons and notes stay in your account exactly as they are. You will continue to access them through the free version, along with the last cloud-free image per field, virtual weather stations and the hyperlocal precipitation map for the next hour.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0"><strong>Can I try a subscription before committing?</strong></p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">Some plans include a trial period. You will see the details directly in the App Store or Google Play before subscribing, and you can cancel anytime, so there is no long-term commitment.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0"><strong>Can I cancel my subscription later?</strong></p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">Yes, anytime. Subscriptions are managed through your App Store or Google Play account, just like any other app. If you cancel, you keep access to subscription features until the end of your current billing period, then return to the free version automatically.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0"><strong>How does pricing work for farms with multiple users?</strong></p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">The subscription is tied to your workspace, not to individual users. One subscription covers all fields, all seasons and everyone invited to your workspace. The price depends on the total area of your active fields and your region, and you will see your exact price in the App Store or Google Play.</p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0"><strong>What if I have OneSoil Pro?</strong></p><p class="mx-auto max-w-[864px] mb-4 text-lg font-light leading-[1.4] text-foreground-primary last:mb-0">If you are a OneSoil Pro customer, all the new mobile subscription features are already included in your existing plan. When you update the app, everything continues to work as before.</p><section aria-labelledby="related-articles-heading" class="relative left-1/2 w-screen -translate-x-1/2 bg-background-secondary"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1024px] px-6 py-8 lg:px-0"><div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-2"><h2 id="related-articles-heading" class="text-[2.25rem] font-normal leading-none tracking-[-0.09rem] text-foreground-primary">More Articles</h2><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" class="shrink-0 fill-current text-foreground-primary" aria-hidden="true"><g transform="translate(0, 0)"><path d="M14 1.75C20.7655 1.75 26.25 7.23451 26.25 14C26.25 20.7655 20.7655 26.25 14 26.25C7.23451 26.25 1.75 20.7655 1.7