-primary group-hover:text-accent-success">5 Agronomic Priorities to Plan Before Spring Begins</h3><span class="mt-1.5 block text-base font-light leading-[1.3] text-foreground-secondary">3 min read</span></a><a class="group !no-underline" href="/en/resources/what-is-ndvi"><div class="mb-3 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white"><img alt="OneSoil - NDVI" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="1200" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2FOneSoil%2520-%2520NDVI.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div><h3 class="text-lg font-light leading-[1.2] text-foreground-primary group-hover:text-accent-success">What NDVI Is and How to Read It on Your Fields</h3><span class="mt-1.5 block text-base font-light leading-[1.3] text-foreground-secondary">4 min read</span></a></div></div></section><section class="bg-cta-banner relative left-1/2 w-screen -translate-x-1/2"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1024px] flex-col items-start gap-6 px-6 py-12 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:px-20 sm:py-12 lg:px-0"><div class="max-w-[520px]"><h2 class="text-[2.5rem] font-normal leading-none tracking-[-0.1rem] text-foreground-primary">Get the OneSoil app</h2><div class="[&amp;_a]:text-accent-success [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:transition-colors [&amp;_a]:hover:text-foreground-primary [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold [&amp;_strong]:text-accent-success"><p class="mt-2.5 text-[1.125rem] font-light leading-[1.2] text-[#004423]">Scan the QR code or pick your store, and add your fields. The free version has no limit on the number of fields.</p></div></div><a class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-foreground-primary px-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-normal leading-none !text-white !no-underline" href="https://onesoil.ai/en/platform">Download the app<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="shrink-0 fill-current" aria-hidden="true"><g transform="translate(0, 0)"><path d="M20.5 10.9395C21.0857 11.5252 21.0857 12.4748 20.5 13.0605L13.0303 20.5303L11.9697 19.4697L18.6895 12.75H3V11.25H18.6895L11.9697 4.53027L13.0303 3.46973L20.5 10.9395Z"></path></g></svg></a></div></section></div></article></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3 bg-background-secondary p-3 md:gap-9 md:px-12 md:py-9 xl:bg-background-primary xl:gap-9 xl:px-14 xl:py-12 3xl:bg-background-secondary 3xl:py-9" aria-labelledby="footer-heading"><h2 id="footer-heading" class="sr-only">OneSoil</h2><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-8 p-3 md:flex-col md:gap-12 md:p-0 md:pb-0 xl:flex-row xl:gap-12 xl:pb-12"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:gap-8 xl:w-[403px] xl:shrink-0 xl:flex-col xl:gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-1"><a class="inline-flex text-[#6D6351]" aria-label="OneSoil" href="/en"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="106" height="48" viewBox="0 0 106 48" fill="none" role="img" class="h-auto w-[106px]"><title>OneSoil</title><path d="M9.15133 35.9642C6.55433 35.9642 4.36367 35.087 2.61467 33.3327C0.865667 31.5